107	16	\N	1	1	Export Translations	base.language.export	\N	form	base/wizard/base_export_language_views.xml	primary	{"en_US": "<form string=\\"Export Translations\\">\\n                    <field name=\\"name\\" invisible=\\"1\\"/> <!-- The name is needed in the BinaryField component used to download the file -->\\n                    <group invisible=\\"state != 'choose'\\" string=\\"Export Settings\\">\\n                        <field name=\\"lang\\"/>\\n                        <field name=\\"format\\"/>\\n                        <field name=\\"export_type\\"/>\\n                        <field name=\\"modules\\" widget=\\"many2many_tags\\" options=\\"{'no_create': True}\\" invisible=\\"export_type == 'model'\\"/>\\n                        <field name=\\"model_id\\" options=\\"{'no_create': True}\\" invisible=\\"export_type == 'module'\\" required=\\"export_type == 'model'\\"/>\\n                        <field name=\\"model_name\\" invisible=\\"1\\"/> <!-- The model_name is needed for the option of the domain -->\\n                        <field name=\\"domain\\" widget=\\"domain\\" options=\\"{'model': 'model_name'}\\" invisible=\\"export_type == 'module'\\"/>\\n                    </group>\\n                    <div invisible=\\"state != 'get'\\">\\n                        <h2>Export Complete</h2>\\n                        <p>Here is the exported translation file: <field name=\\"data\\" readonly=\\"1\\" filename=\\"name\\"/></p>\\n                        <p>This file was generated using the universal <strong>Unicode/UTF-8</strong> file encoding, please be sure to view and edit\\n                           using the same encoding.</p>\\n                        <p>The next step depends on the file format:\\n                            <ul>\\n                            <li>CSV format: you may edit it directly with your favorite spreadsheet software,\\n                                the rightmost column (value) contains the translations</li>\\n                            <li>PO(T) format: you should edit it with a PO editor such as\\n                                <a href=\\"http://www.poedit.net/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">POEdit</a>, or your preferred text editor</li>\\n                            <li>TGZ format: bundles multiple PO(T) files as a single archive</li>\\n                            </ul>\\n                        </p>\\n                        <p>For more details about translating Odoo in your language, please refer to the\\n                           <a href=\\"https://github.com/odoo/odoo/wiki/Translations\\" target=\\"_blank\\">documentation</a>.</p>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <footer invisible=\\"state != 'choose'\\">\\n                        <button name=\\"act_getfile\\" string=\\"Export\\" type=\\"object\\" class=\\"btn-primary\\" data-hotkey=\\"q\\"/>\\n                        <button special=\\"cancel\\" data-hotkey=\\"x\\" string=\\"Cancel\\" type=\\"object\\" class=\\"btn-secondary\\"/>\\n                    </footer>\\n                    <footer invisible=\\"state != 'get'\\">\\n                        <button special=\\"cancel\\" data-hotkey=\\"x\\" string=\\"Close\\" type=\\"object\\" class=\\"btn-primary\\"/>\\n                    </footer>\\n                </form>", "vi_VN": "<form string=\\"Xuất Bản dịch\\">\\n                    <field name=\\"name\\" invisible=\\"1\\"/> <!-- The name is needed in the BinaryField component used to download the file -->\\n                    <group invisible=\\"state != 'choose'\\" string=\\"Thiết lập Xuất\\">\\n                        <field name=\\"lang\\"/>\\n                        <field name=\\"format\\"/>\\n                        <field name=\\"export_type\\"/>\\n                        <field name=\\"modules\\" widget=\\"many2many_tags\\" options=\\"{'no_create': True}\\" invisible=\\"export_type == 'model'\\"/>\\n                        <field name=\\"model_id\\" options=\\"{'no_create': True}\\" invisible=\\"export_type == 'module'\\" required=\\"export_type == 'model'\\"/>\\n                        <field name=\\"model_name\\" invisible=\\"1\\"/> <!-- The model_name is needed for the option of the domain -->\\n                        <field name=\\"domain\\" widget=\\"domain\\" options=\\"{'model': 'model_name'}\\" invisible=\\"export_type == 'module'\\"/>\\n                    </group>\\n                    <div invisible=\\"state != 'get'\\">\\n                        <h2>Xuất Thành công</h2>\\n                        <p>Đây là bản dịch đã được xuất: <field name=\\"data\\" readonly=\\"1\\" filename=\\"name\\"/></p>\\n                        <p>Tệp này được tạo bằng cách sử dụng mã hóa tệp <strong>Unicode/UTF-8</strong> phổ biến, vui lòng đảm bảo xem và chỉnh sửa\\n                            với cùng một cách mã hóa.</p>\\n                        <p>Bước tiếp theo phụ thuộc vào định dạng tệp:\\n                            <ul>\\n                            <li>Định dạng CSV: bạn có thể chỉnh sửa trực tiếp bằng phần mềm bảng tính ưa thích,\\n                                cột (giá trị) cực phải chứa các bản dịch</li>\\n                            <li>Định dạng PO(T): bạn nên chỉnh sửa với một trình soạn thảo PO như\\n                                <a href=\\"http://www.poedit.net/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">POEdit</a>, hoặc trình biên tập văn bản ưa thích của bạn</li>\\n                            <li>Định dạng TGZ: gói nhiều file PO(T) dưới dạng một file nén</li>\\n                            </ul>\\n                        </p>\\n                        <p>Để tìm hiểu thêm thông tin về việc dịch Odoo sang ngôn ngữ của bạn, vui lòng truy cập\\n                           <a href=\\"https://github.com/odoo/odoo/wiki/Translations\\" target=\\"_blank\\">tài liệu</a>.</p>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <footer invisible=\\"state != 'choose'\\">\\n                        <button name=\\"act_getfile\\" string=\\"Xuất\\" type=\\"object\\" class=\\"btn-primary\\" data-hotkey=\\"q\\"/>\\n                        <button special=\\"cancel\\" data-hotkey=\\"x\\" string=\\"Hủy\\" type=\\"object\\" class=\\"btn-secondary\\"/>\\n                    </footer>\\n                    <footer invisible=\\"state != 'get'\\">\\n                        <button special=\\"cancel\\" data-hotkey=\\"x\\" string=\\"Đóng\\" type=\\"object\\" class=\\"btn-primary\\"/>\\n                    </footer>\\n                </form>"}	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<form string="Export Translations">\n                    <field name="name" invisible="1"/> <!-- The name is needed in the BinaryField component used to download the file -->\n                    <group invisible="state != 'choose'" string="Export Settings">\n                        <field name="lang"/>\n                        <field name="format"/>\n                        <field name="export_type"/>\n                        <field name="modules" widget="many2many_tags" options="{'no_create': True}" invisible="export_type == 'model'"/>\n                        <field name="model_id" options="{'no_create': True}" invisible="export_type == 'module'" required="export_type == 'model'"/>\n                        <field name="model_name" invisible="1"/> <!-- The model_name is needed for the option of the domain -->\n                        <field name="domain" widget="domain" options="{'model': 'model_name'}" invisible="export_type == 'module'"/>\n                    </group>\n                    <div invisible="state != 'get'">\n                        <h2>Export Complete</h2>\n                        <p>Here is the exported translation file: <field name="data" readonly="1" filename="name"/></p>\n                        <p>This file was generated using the universal <strong>Unicode/UTF-8</strong> file encoding, please be sure to view and edit\n                           using the same encoding.</p>\n                        <p>The next step depends on the file format:\n                            <ul>\n                            <li>CSV format: you may edit it directly with your favorite spreadsheet software,\n                                the rightmost column (value) contains the translations</li>\n                            <li>PO(T) format: you should edit it with a PO editor such as\n                                <a href="http://www.poedit.net/" target="_blank">POEdit</a>, or your preferred text editor</li>\n                            <li>TGZ format: bundles multiple PO(T) files as a single archive</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </p>\n                        <p>For more details about translating Odoo in your language, please refer to the\n                           <a href="https://github.com/odoo/odoo/wiki/Translations" target="_blank">documentation</a>.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <footer invisible="state != 'choose'">\n                        <button name="act_getfile" string="Export" type="object" class="btn-primary" data-hotkey="q"/>\n                        <button special="cancel" data-hotkey="x" string="Cancel" type="object" class="btn-secondary"/>\n                    </footer>\n                    <footer invisible="state != 'get'">\n                        <button special="cancel" data-hotkey="x" string="Close" type="object" class="btn-primary"/>\n                    </footer>\n                </form>\n            	f	t	2025-09-03 13:11:11.082343	2025-09-03 13:11:11.082343
108	16	\N	1	1	base.partner.merge.automatic.wizard.form	base.partner.merge.automatic.wizard	\N	form	base/wizard/base_partner_merge_views.xml	primary	{"en_US": "<form string=\\"Automatic Merge Wizard\\" class=\\"o_partner_merge_wizard\\">\\n                    <sheet>\\n                        <group invisible=\\"state != 'finished'\\">\\n                            <h2 colspan=\\"2\\">There are no more contacts to merge for this request</h2>\\n                            <button name=\\"49\\" string=\\"Deduplicate the other Contacts\\" class=\\"oe_highlight\\" type=\\"action\\" colspan=\\"2\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <p class=\\"oe_grey\\" invisible=\\"state != 'option'\\">\\n                            Select the list of fields used to search for\\n                            duplicated records. If you select several fields,\\n                            Odoo will propose you to merge only those having\\n                            all these fields in common. (not one of the fields).\\n                        </p>\\n                        <group invisible=\\"state not in ('selection', 'finished') or number_group == 0\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"number_group\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <group string=\\"Search duplicates based on duplicated data in\\" invisible=\\"state not in ('option',)\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_email\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_name\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_is_company\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_vat\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_parent_id\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <group string=\\"Exclude contacts having\\" invisible=\\"state not in ('option',)\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"exclude_contact\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"exclude_journal_item\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <separator string=\\"Options\\" invisible=\\"state not in ('option',)\\"/>\\n                        <group invisible=\\"state not in ('option', 'finished')\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"maximum_group\\" readonly=\\"state == 'finished'\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <separator string=\\"Merge the following contacts\\" invisible=\\"state in ('option', 'finished')\\"/>\\n                        <group invisible=\\"state in ('option', 'finished')\\" col=\\"1\\">\\n                            <p class=\\"oe_grey\\">\\n                                Selected contacts will be merged together.\\n                                All documents linked to one of these contacts\\n                                will be redirected to the destination contact.\\n                                You can remove contacts from this list to avoid merging them.\\n                            </p>\\n                            <group col=\\"2\\">\\n                                <field name=\\"dst_partner_id\\" domain=\\"[('id', 'in', partner_ids or False)]\\" required=\\"state == 'selection'\\" context=\\"{'partner_show_db_id': True}\\"/>\\n                            </group>\\n                            <field name=\\"partner_ids\\" nolabel=\\"1\\">\\n                                <list string=\\"Partners\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"id\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"display_name\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"email\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"is_company\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"vat\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"country_id\\"/>\\n                                </list>\\n                            </field>\\n                        </group>\\n                    </sheet>\\n                    <footer>\\n                        <button name=\\"action_merge\\" string=\\"Merge Contacts\\" class=\\"oe_highlight\\" type=\\"object\\" data-hotkey=\\"q\\" invisible=\\"state in ('option', 'finished')\\"/>\\n                        <button name=\\"action_skip\\" string=\\"Skip these contacts\\" type=\\"object\\" invisible=\\"state != 'selection'\\"/>\\n                        <button name=\\"action_start_manual_process\\" string=\\"Merge with Manual Check\\" data-hotkey=\\"w\\" type=\\"object\\" class=\\"oe_highlight\\" invisible=\\"state != 'option'\\"/>\\n                        <button name=\\"action_start_automatic_process\\" string=\\"Merge Automatically\\" data-hotkey=\\"l\\" type=\\"object\\" class=\\"oe_highlight\\" confirm=\\"Are you sure to execute the automatic merge of your contacts?\\" invisible=\\"state != 'option'\\"/>\\n                        <button name=\\"action_update_all_process\\" string=\\"Merge Automatically all process\\" type=\\"object\\" data-hotkey=\\"y\\" confirm=\\"Are you sure to execute the list of automatic merges of your contacts?\\" invisible=\\"state != 'option'\\"/>\\n                        <button special=\\"cancel\\" data-hotkey=\\"x\\" string=\\"Cancel\\" type=\\"object\\" class=\\"btn btn-secondary oe_inline\\" invisible=\\"state == 'finished'\\"/>\\n                        <button special=\\"cancel\\" data-hotkey=\\"x\\" string=\\"Close\\" type=\\"object\\" class=\\"btn btn-secondary oe_inline\\" invisible=\\"state != 'finished'\\"/>\\n                    </footer>\\n                </form>", "vi_VN": "<form string=\\"Trình Hợp nhất Tự động\\" class=\\"o_partner_merge_wizard\\">\\n                    <sheet>\\n                        <group invisible=\\"state != 'finished'\\">\\n                            <h2 colspan=\\"2\\">Không có thêm liên hệ để hợp nhất cho yêu cầu này</h2>\\n                            <button name=\\"49\\" string=\\"Chống trùng lặp các liên hệ khác\\" class=\\"oe_highlight\\" type=\\"action\\" colspan=\\"2\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <p class=\\"oe_grey\\" invisible=\\"state != 'option'\\">\\n                            Chọn danh sách các trường được sử dụng để tìm kiếm\\n                            các bản ghi trùng lặp. Nếu bạn chọn nhiều trường,\\n                            Odoo sẽ đề xuất bạn chỉ gộp những bản ghi có\\n                            tất cả các trường được chọn có giá trị giống nhau (không phải chỉ một trong số các trường).\\n                        </p>\\n                        <group invisible=\\"state not in ('selection', 'finished') or number_group == 0\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"number_group\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <group string=\\"Tìm các dữ liệu bị trùng lặp dựa trên dữ liệu\\" invisible=\\"state not in ('option',)\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_email\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_name\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_is_company\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_vat\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_parent_id\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <group string=\\"Loại trừ liên hệ có\\" invisible=\\"state not in ('option',)\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"exclude_contact\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"exclude_journal_item\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <separator string=\\"Tùy chọn\\" invisible=\\"state not in ('option',)\\"/>\\n                        <group invisible=\\"state not in ('option', 'finished')\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"maximum_group\\" readonly=\\"state == 'finished'\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <separator string=\\"Gộp các liên hệ sau\\" invisible=\\"state in ('option', 'finished')\\"/>\\n                        <group invisible=\\"state in ('option', 'finished')\\" col=\\"1\\">\\n                            <p class=\\"oe_grey\\">\\n                                Các liên hệ được chọn sẽ được gộp vào nhau.\\n                                Tất cả các tài liệu liên kết đến một trong số\\n                                các liên hệ này sẽ được chuyển hướng đến liên\\n                                đích. Bạn có thể xoá bớt các liên hệ trong danh sách này\\n                                để tránh việc gộp chúng.\\n                            </p>\\n                            <group col=\\"2\\">\\n                                <field name=\\"dst_partner_id\\" domain=\\"[('id', 'in', partner_ids or False)]\\" required=\\"state == 'selection'\\" context=\\"{'partner_show_db_id': True}\\"/>\\n                            </group>\\n                            <field name=\\"partner_ids\\" nolabel=\\"1\\">\\n                                <list string=\\"Đối tác\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"id\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"display_name\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"email\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"is_company\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"vat\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"country_id\\"/>\\n                                </list>\\n                            </field>\\n                        </group>\\n                    </sheet>\\n                    <footer>\\n                        <button name=\\"action_merge\\" string=\\"Gộp liên hệ\\" class=\\"oe_highlight\\" type=\\"object\\" data-hotkey=\\"q\\" invisible=\\"state in ('option', 'finished')\\"/>\\n                        <button name=\\"action_skip\\" string=\\"Bỏ qua các liên hệ này\\" type=\\"object\\" invisible=\\"state != 'selection'\\"/>\\n                        <button name=\\"action_start_manual_process\\" string=\\"Gộp thông qua kiểm tra thủ